#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/adjustments.rst:23
msgid ""
"Odoo's **Barcode** application provides demo data with barcodes to explore "
"the features of the app. These can be used for testing purposes, and can be "
"printed from the home screen of the app."
msgstr ""
"De **Barcode**-applicatie van Odoo biedt demodata met barcodes om de "
"functies van de app te verkennen. Deze kunnen worden gebruikt voor "
"testdoeleinden en kunnen worden afgedrukt vanaf het startscherm van de app."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/adjustments.rst:26
msgid ""
"To access this demo data, navigate to the :menuselection:`Barcode app` and "
"click :guilabel:`demo data sheet` or :guilabel:`barcodes` in the banner "
"above the scanner."
msgstr ""
"Navigeer naar de :menuselection:`Barcode-app` en klik op :guilabel:`demodata "
"sheet` of :guilabel:`barcodes` in de banner boven de scanner om deze "
"demodata te openen."

