#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/gs1_usage.rst:54
msgid ""
"First, :ref:`enable product tracking using lots <inventory/management/"
"track_products_by_lots>` by navigating to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`, and checking the box for :guilabel:`Lots & "
"Serial Numbers` under the :guilabel:`Traceability` heading."
msgstr ""
"Schakel eerst :ref:`producttracking met lots in <inventory/management/"
"track_products_by_lots>` door te navigeren naar :menuselection:`Voorraad app "
"--> Configuratie --> Instellingen`, en vink het vakje aan "
"voor :guilabel:`Lots & Serienummers` onder de "
"kop :guilabel:`Traceerbaarheid`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/gs1_usage.rst:58
msgid ""
"Then, set up the product barcode by navigating to the intended product form "
"in :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Products --> Products` and selecting "
"the product. On the product form, click :guilabel:`Edit`. Then, in "
"the :guilabel:`General Information` tab, fill in the :guilabel:`Barcode` "
"field with the unique 14-digit `Global Trade Item Number (GTIN) <https://"
"www.gs1.org/standards/get-barcodes>`_, which is a universally recognized "
"identifying number that is provided by GS1."
msgstr ""
"Stel vervolgens de productbarcode in door te navigeren naar het beoogde "
"productformulier in :menuselection:`Voorraad app --> Producten --> "
"Producten` en selecteer het product. Klik op het productformulier "
"op :guilabel:`Bewerken`. Vul vervolgens in het tabblad :guilabel:`Algemene "
"Informatie` het veld :guilabel:`Barcode` in met het unieke 14-cijferige "
"`Global Trade Item Number (GTIN) <https://www.gs1.org/standards/get-"
"barcodes>`_, een universeel erkend identificatienummer dat wordt geleverd "
"door GS1."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/gs1_usage.rst:66
msgid ""
"On the product form, omit the |AI| `01` for |GTIN| product barcode pattern, "
"as it is only used to encode multiple barcodes into a single barcode that "
"contains detailed information about the package contents."
msgstr ""
"Laat op het productformulier de |AI| `01` voor |GTIN| productbarcodepatroon "
"weg, omdat deze alleen wordt gebruikt om meerdere barcodes te coderen in een "
"enkele barcode die gedetailleerde informatie over de pakketinhoud bevat."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/gs1_usage.rst:72
msgid ""
"To record the GS1 barcode for the product, `Fuji Apple`, enter the 14-digit |"
"GTIN| `20611628936004` in the :guilabel:`Barcode` field on the product form."
msgstr ""
"Om de GS1 barcode voor het product `Fuji Apple` vast te leggen, voer je het "
"14-cijferige |GTIN| `20611628936004` in het veld :guilabel:`Barcode` op het "
"productformulier in."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/gs1_usage.rst:75
msgid "Enter 14-digit GTIN into the Barcode field on product form."
msgstr "Voer 14-cijferig GTIN in het Barcode veld op het productformulier in."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/gs1_usage.rst:80
msgid ""
"To view a list of *all* products and their corresponding barcodes in the "
"Odoo database, navigate to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --"
"> Settings`. Under the :guilabel:`Barcode` heading, click on "
"the :guilabel:`Configure Product Barcodes` button under "
"the :guilabel:`Barcode Scanner` section. Enter the 14-digit |GTIN| into "
"the :guilabel:`Barcode` column, then click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"Om een lijst te bekijken van *alle* producten en hun bijbehorende barcodes "
"in de Odoo database, navigeer naar :menuselection:`Voorraad app --> "
"Configuratie --> Instellingen`. Klik onder de kop :guilabel:`Barcode` op de "
"knop :guilabel:`Productbarcodes Configureren` onder de "
"sectie :guilabel:`Barcodescanner`. Voer het 14-cijferige |GTIN| in de "
"kolom :guilabel:`Barcode` in en klik vervolgens op :guilabel:`Opslaan`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/gs1_usage.rst:86
msgid "View the Product Barcodes page from inventory settings."
msgstr "Bekijk de pagina Productbarcodes vanuit de voorraad-instellingen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/gs1_usage.rst:92
msgid ""
"After activating tracking by lots and serial numbers from the settings page, "
"specify that this feature is to be applied on each product by navigating to "
"the :guilabel:`Inventory` tab on the product form. "
"Under :guilabel:`Tracking`, choose the :guilabel:`By Lots` radio button."
msgstr ""
"Nadat je tracking per lot en serienummer hebt geactiveerd via de "
"instellingenpagina, geef je aan dat deze functie op elk product moet worden "
"toegepast door te navigeren naar het tabblad :guilabel:`Voorraad` op het "
"productformulier. Kies onder :guilabel:`Tracking` het "
"keuzerondje :guilabel:`Per lot`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/gs1_usage.rst:96
msgid ""
"Enable product tracking by lots in the \"Inventory\" tab of the product form."
msgstr ""
"Schakel producttracking per lot in op het tabblad \"Voorraad\" van het "
"productformulier."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/gs1_usage.rst:101
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/gs1_usage.rst:176
msgid "Scan barcode on receipt"
msgstr "Scan barcode bij ontvangst"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/gs1_usage.rst:103
msgid ""
"To ensure accurate lot interpretation in Odoo on product barcodes scanned "
"during a receipt operation, navigate to the :menuselection:`Barcode` app to "
"manage the :ref:`receipt picking process <barcode/operations/scan-received-"
"products>`."
msgstr ""
"Om nauwkeurige lotinterpretatie in Odoo te garanderen bij productbarcodes "
"die zijn gescand tijdens een ontvangstbewerking, navigeer je naar "
"de :menuselection:`Barcode`-app om het :ref:`ontvangst-pickingproces "
"<barcode/operations/scan-received-products>` te beheren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/gs1_usage.rst:107
msgid ""
"From the :guilabel:`Barcode Scanning` dashboard, click "
"the :guilabel:`Operations` button, then the :guilabel:`Receipts` button to "
"view the list of vendor receipts to process. Receipts generated "
"from :abbr:`POs (Purchase Orders)` are listed, but new receipt operations "
"can also be created directly through the :menuselection:`Barcode` app using "
"the :guilabel:`Create` button."
msgstr ""
"Klik op het dashboard :guilabel:`Barcode scannen` op de "
"knop :guilabel:`Bewerkingen` en vervolgens op de "
"knop :guilabel:`Ontvangsten` om de lijst met te verwerken leveranciers-"
"ontvangsten te bekijken. Ontvangsten die zijn gegenereerd vanuit :abbr:`PO's "
"(inkooporders)` worden weergegeven, maar nieuwe ontvangstbewerkingen kunnen "
"ook rechtstreeks worden aangemaakt via de :menuselection:`Barcode`-app met "
"de knop :guilabel:`Aanmaken`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/gs1_usage.rst:112
msgid ""
"On the list of receipts, click on the warehouse operation (`WH/IN`) and scan "
"product barcodes and lot numbers with a barcode scanner. The scanned product "
"then appears on the list. Use the :guilabel:`✏️ (pencil)` button to open a "
"window and manually enter quantities for specific lot numbers."
msgstr ""
