#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/process_transfers.rst:5
msgid ""
"The Odoo **Barcode** app can be used to process *Batch*, *Wave*, and "
"*Cluster* transfers that are created in the **Inventory** app."
msgstr ""
"De Odoo **Barcode**-app kan worden gebruikt om *Batch*-, *Wave*- en "
"*Cluster*-transfers te verwerken die in de **Voorraad**-app zijn aangemaakt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/process_transfers.rst:9
