"sectie :guilabel:`Logistiek`, kan :guilabel:`Reserveer Verpakkingen` worden "
"ingesteld op :guilabel:`Reserveer Alleen Volledige Verpakkingen` "
"of :guilabel:`Reserveer Gedeeltelijke Verpakkingen`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging.rst:132
msgid ""
"To see the :guilabel:`Reserve Packaging` field, the :guilabel:`Product "
