msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/product_tracking/serial_numbers.rst:309
msgid ""
"To view the serial numbers of products included in the order, make sure "
"the :guilabel:`Operations` tab is open, then click the :icon:`oi-settings-"
"adjust` :guilabel:`(adjust)` icon to the right of the tab. Ensure that "
"the :guilabel:`Serial Numbers` checkbox is selected, which causes "
"a :guilabel:`Serial Numbers` column to appear. The serial numbers for each "
"product included in the order are displayed in this column."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/product_tracking/serial_numbers.rst:318
msgid ""
"At the top of the order's form, click the :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`(Actions)` button, and select :icon:`fa-"
"print` :menuselection:`Print --> Delivery Slip`. The delivery slip is "
"downloaded. Open the delivery slip using the device's browser or file "
"manager. Serial numbers are listed next to their respective products in "
"the :guilabel:`Lot/Serial Number` column."
msgstr ""
"Klik bovenaan het formulier van de order op de knop :icon:`fa-cog` "
":guilabel:`(Acties)` en selecteer :menuselection:`Afdrukken --> "
"Leveringsbon`. De leveringsbon wordt vervolgens gedownload. Open de "
"leveringsbon met de browser of bestandsbeheerder van het apparaat. "
"Serienummers worden naast de betreffende producten vermeld in de kolom "
":guilabel:`Partij-/serienummer`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/product_tracking/serial_numbers.rst:327
