#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fifo.rst:57
msgid "On the location"
msgstr "Op de locatie"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:72
msgid ""
"Open :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Locations`. Select "
"the desired location. On the location form, under the :guilabel:`Logistics` "
"heading, select :guilabel:`First Expiry First Out (FEFO)` from the list of "
"removal strategies."
msgstr ""
"Open :menuselection:`Voorraad-app --> Configuratie --> Locaties`. Selecteer "
"de gewenste locatie. Selecteer op het locatieformulier onder de "
"kop :guilabel:`Logistiek` de optie :guilabel:`First Expiry First Out (FEFO)` "
"uit de lijst met verwijderstrategieën."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:76
msgid "Set First Expiry First Out as the location removal strategy."
msgstr "Stel First Expiry First Out in als verwijderstrategie voor de locatie."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:80
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fifo.rst:67
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/least_packages.rst:74
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/lifo.rst:73
msgid "On the product category"
msgstr "Op de productcategorie"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:82
msgid ""
"Configure removal strategies on product categories by going "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Categories` and "
"selecting the intended product category. Next, in the :guilabel:`Force "
"Removal Strategy` field, specify :guilabel:`First Expiry First Out (FEFO)`."
msgstr ""
"Configureer verwijderstrategieën voor productcategorieën door "
"naar :menuselection:`Voorraad-app --> Configuratie --> Categorieën` te gaan "
"en de betreffende productcategorie te selecteren. Geef vervolgens in het "
"veld :guilabel:`Verwijderstrategie afdwingen` de optie :guilabel:`First "
"Expiry First Out (FEFO)` op."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:86
msgid "Set First Expiry First Out as the product category removal strategy."
msgstr ""
"Stel First Expiry First Out in als verwijderstrategie voor de "
"productcategorie."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:90
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fifo.rst:77
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/least_packages.rst:84
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/lifo.rst:84
msgid ""
"When there are different removal strategies applied on both the location and "
"product category for a product, the value set on the :guilabel:`Force "
"Removal Strategy` field set on a product category form is applied as top "
"priority."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer er verschillende verwijderstrategieën zijn toegepast op zowel de "
"locatie als de productcategorie voor een product, wordt de waarde in het "
"veld :guilabel:`Verwijderstrategie afdwingen` op een "
"productcategorieformulier toegepast met de hoogste prioriteit."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:97
msgid "Removal date"
msgstr "Verwijderdatum"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:99
msgid ""
"Before setting this date, ensure that the :guilabel:`Tracking` property "
"field is set to :guilabel:`By Lots` or :guilabel:`By Unique Serial Number`."
msgstr ""
"Zorg er vóór het instellen van deze datum voor dat het eigenschapsveld "
":guilabel:`Tracering` is ingesteld op :guilabel:`Op partijen` of "
":guilabel:`Op uniek serienummer`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:102
msgid ""
"Set this number of days by navigating to the product "
"form's :guilabel:`Inventory` tab. Next, select the :guilabel:`Expiration "
"Date` option, which makes the :guilabel:`Removal Date` field (and other date "
"fields) appear."
msgstr ""
"Stel dit aantal dagen in door naar het tabblad :guilabel:`Voorraad` van het "
"productformulier te navigeren. Selecteer vervolgens de optie "
":guilabel:`Vervaldatum`, waardoor het veld :guilabel:`Verwijderingsdatum` "
"(en andere datumvelden) verschijnt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:107
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Lots and Serial Numbers` and :guilabel:`Expiration Dates` "
"features **must** be enabled in :menuselection:`Inventory app --> "
"Configuration --> Settings` to track expiration dates."
msgstr ""
"De functies :guilabel:`Partijen en serienummers` en :guilabel:`Vervaldatums` "
"**moeten** zijn ingeschakeld in :menuselection:`Voorraad-app --> "
"Configuratie --> Instellingen` om vervaldatums bij te houden."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:111
msgid ""
"Set the :guilabel:`Expiration Date`, :guilabel:`Best Before "
"Date`, :guilabel:`Removal Date`, and the :guilabel:`Alert Date`."
msgstr ""
"Stel de :guilabel:`Vervaldatum`, :guilabel:`Ten minste houdbaar tot-datum`, "
":guilabel:`Verwijderingsdatum` en de :guilabel:`Waarschuwingsdatum` in."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:115
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Inventory` tab of the product, `Egg`, the "
"following :guilabel:`Dates` are set by the user:"
msgstr ""
"In het tabblad :guilabel:`Voorraad` van het product `Ei` worden de "
"volgende :guilabel:`Datums` ingesteld door de gebruiker:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:118
msgid ":guilabel:`Expiration Date`: `30` days after receipt"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Vervaldatum`: `30` dagen na ontvangst"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:119
msgid ":guilabel:`Removal Date`: `15` days before expiration date"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Verwijderdatum`: `15` dagen vóór vervaldatum"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:121
msgid "Display expiration and removal dates set on the product form."
msgstr "Toon vervaldatum en verwijderdatum ingesteld op het productformulier."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:124
msgid ""
"A shipment of Eggs arrive at the warehouse on January 1st. So, the "
"expiration date of the Eggs is **January 31st** (Jan 1st + 30). By "
"extension, the removal date is **January 16th** (Jan 31 - 15)."
msgstr ""
"Een zending eieren arriveert op 1 januari in het magazijn. De vervaldatum "
"van de eieren is dus **31 januari** (1 jan + 30). De verwijderdatum is **16 "
"januari** (31 jan - 15)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:130
msgid ""
