"en de beoogde productcategorie te selecteren. Geef vervolgens in het "
"veld :guilabel:`Verwijderstrategie forceren` de optie :guilabel:`First In "
"First Out (FIFO)` op."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fifo.rst:73
msgid "Set First In First Out as the product category removal strategy."
msgstr ""
