#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/bpost.rst:25
msgid ""
"To begin, go to the `Bpost website <https://parcel.bpost.be/en/home/"
"business>`_ to create, or log into, the company's Bpost business account. "
"When creating the Bpost account, have the company's VAT number and mobile "
"phone number ready."
msgstr ""
"Ga om te beginnen naar de `Bpost-website <https://parcel.bpost.be/en/home/"
"business>`_ om de zakelijke Bpost-rekening van het bedrijf aan te maken of "
"in te loggen. Houd bij het aanmaken van de Bpost-rekening het btw-nummer en "
"mobiele telefoonnummer van het bedrijf bij de hand."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/bpost.rst:29
msgid ""
"Follow the website's steps to complete registration, and sign up for "
"shipping services. Doing so submits a request to enter a contractual "
"business relationship between the company and Bpost."
msgstr ""
"Volg de stappen op de website om de registratie te voltooien en meld je aan "
"voor verzendservices. Hiermee dien je een verzoek in om een contractuele "
"zakelijke relatie aan te gaan tussen het bedrijf en Bpost."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/bpost.rst:33
msgid ""
"Odoo **cannot** be integrated with `non-business Bpost <https://www.odoo.com/"
"r/Z4wZ>`_ accounts."
msgstr ""
"Odoo kan **niet** worden geïntegreerd met `niet-zakelijke Bpost-<https://"
"www.odoo.com/r/Z4wZ>`_-rekeningen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/bpost.rst:35
msgid ""
"After completing the setup, get the Bpost account ID and passphrase, by "
"navigating to the :guilabel:`Shipping Manager` menu item."
msgstr ""
"Haal na het voltooien van de installatie het Bpost-rekening-ID en de "
"wachtwoordzin op door naar het menu-item :guilabel:`Shipping Manager` te "
"gaan."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/bpost.rst:40
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Shipping Manager` page, go to the :guilabel:`Admin` tab, "
"then the :guilabel:`General Settings` tab, to find the :guilabel:`Account "
"ID` and :guilabel:`Passphrase` needed to configure Odoo's shipping method."
msgstr ""
"Ga op de :guilabel:`Shipping Manager`-pagina naar het "
"tabblad :guilabel:`Admin` en vervolgens naar het tabblad :guilabel:`General "
"Settings` om het :guilabel:`Account ID` en de :guilabel:`Passphrase` te "
"vinden die nodig zijn om de verzendmethode van Odoo te configureren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/bpost.rst:44
msgid "In the *Admin* tab, show the Account ID and Passphrase."
msgstr "Toon in het tabblad *Admin* het account-ID en de wachtwoordzin."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/bpost.rst:50
msgid "Shipping method configuration"
msgstr "Configuratie verzendmethode"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/bpost.rst:52
msgid ""
"With those necessary credentials, configure the Bpost shipping method in "
"Odoo by going to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> "
"Shipping Methods`."
msgstr ""
"Configureer met deze benodigde inloggegevens de Bpost-verzendmethode in Odoo "
"door naar :menuselection:`Voorraad-app --> Configuratie --> Verzendmethoden` "
"te gaan."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/bpost.rst:55
msgid "On the :guilabel:`Shipping Methods` page, click :guilabel:`Create`."
msgstr "Klik op de :guilabel:`Verzendmethoden`-pagina op :guilabel:`Aanmaken`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/bpost.rst:57
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Provider` field, select :guilabel:`Bpost` from the drop-"
"down menu. Doing so reveals the :guilabel:`Bpost Configuration` tab at the "
"bottom of the form, where the Bpost credentials can be entered."
msgstr ""
"Selecteer in het veld :guilabel:`Provider` :guilabel:`Bpost` in het "
"vervolgkeuzemenu. Hierdoor verschijnt het tabblad :guilabel:`Bpost "
"Configuration` onderaan het formulier, waar de Bpost-inloggegevens kunnen "
"worden ingevoerd."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/bpost.rst:61
msgid ""
"For details on configuring the other fields on the shipping method, such "
"as :guilabel:`Delivery Product`, refer to the :doc:`Configure third-party "
"carrier <third_party_shipper>` documentation."
msgstr ""
"Raadpleeg voor details over het configureren van de andere velden in de "
"verzendmethode, zoals :guilabel:`Delivery Product`, de "
"documentatie :doc:`Externe vervoerder configureren <third_party_shipper>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/bpost.rst:65
msgid ""
"To generate Bpost :doc:`shipping labels <labels>` through Odoo, ensure "
"the :guilabel:`Integration Level` option is set to :guilabel:`Get Rate and "
"Create Shipment`."
msgstr ""
"Zorg ervoor dat de optie :guilabel:`Integration Level` is ingesteld "
"op :guilabel:`Get Rate and Create Shipment` om Bpost-:doc:`verzendlabels "
"<labels>` via Odoo te genereren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/bpost.rst:68
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Bpost Configuration` tab, complete the following fields:"
msgstr ""
"Vul in het tabblad :guilabel:`Bpost Configuration` de volgende velden in:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/bpost.rst:70
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Bpost Account Number` (required field): enter the company's "
"unique :ref:`account ID <inventory/shipping_receiving/bpost-account>` from "
"the Bpost website."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Bpost Account Number` (verplicht veld): voer het "
"unieke :ref:`rekening-ID <inventory/shipping_receiving/bpost-account>` van "
"het bedrijf in van de Bpost-website."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/bpost.rst:72
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Passphrase` (required field): enter the :ref:`passphrase "
"<inventory/shipping_receiving/bpost-account>` from the Bpost website."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Wachtwoord` (verplicht veld): voer het :ref:`wachtwoord "
"<inventory/shipping_receiving/bpost-account>` in van de Bpost-website."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/bpost.rst:74
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Bpost Delivery Nature`: select either :guilabel:`Domestic` "
"or :guilabel:`International` shipping services. "
"Choosing :guilabel:`Domestic` shows the :guilabel:`Options` section, "
"while :guilabel:`International` enables the :guilabel:`Bpost Shipment Type` "
"and :guilabel:`Bpost Parcel Return Instructions` fields."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Bpost leveringstype`: selecteer ofwel :guilabel:`Binnenland` "
"of :guilabel:`Internationaal`. Bij :guilabel:`Binnenland` verschijnt de "
"sectie :guilabel:`Opties`, terwijl :guilabel:`Internationaal` de "
"velden :guilabel:`Bpost verzendtype` en :guilabel:`Bpost pakketretouren "
"instructies` activeert."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/bpost.rst:78
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Bpost Package Type`: select the type of shipping service from the "
"drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Bpost pakkettype`: selecteer het type leveringsdienst uit het "
"vervolgkeuzemenu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/bpost.rst:80
msgid ""
"For `domestic delivery <https://www.odoo.com/r/uOVM>`_, the options "
"are: :guilabel:`bpack 24h Pro`, :guilabel:`bpack 24h business`, "
"or :guilabel:`bpack Bus`."
msgstr ""
"Voor `binnenlandse levering <https://www.odoo.com/r/uOVM>`_ zijn de "
"opties: :guilabel:`bpack 24h Pro`, :guilabel:`bpack 24h business`, "
"of :guilabel:`bpack Bus`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/bpost.rst:83
msgid ""
"For `international delivery <https://www.odoo.com/r/s6G>`_, the options "
"are: :guilabel:`bpack World Express Pro`, :guilabel:`bpack World Business`, "
"or :guilabel:`bpack Europe Business`."
msgstr ""
"Voor `internationale levering <https://www.odoo.com/r/s6G>`_ zijn de "
"opties: :guilabel:`bpack World Express Pro`, :guilabel:`bpack World "
"Business`, of :guilabel:`bpack Europe Business`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/bpost.rst:85
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Bpost Shipment Type` (required field): for international "
"deliveries, declare the type of goods in the package "
"as :guilabel:`SAMPLE`, :guilabel:`GIFT`, :guilabel:`GOODS`, :guilabel:`DOCUMENTS`, "
"or :guilabel:`OTHER`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Bpost verzendtype` (verplicht veld): geef voor internationale "
"leveringen het type goederen in het pakket aan "
"als :guilabel:`SAMPLE`, :guilabel:`GIFT`, :guilabel:`GOODS`, :guilabel:`DOCUMENTS`, "
"of :guilabel:`OTHER`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/bpost.rst:88
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Bpost Parcel Return Address`: return address when an "
"international shipment fails to deliver. Select from the drop-down "
"menu: :guilabel:`Destroy`, :guilabel:`Return to sender by air`, "
"or :guilabel:`Return to sender by road`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Bpost pakket retouradres`: retouradres wanneer een internationale "
"zending niet kan worden afgeleverd. Selecteer uit het "
"vervolgkeuzemenu: :guilabel:`Vernietigen`, :guilabel:`Terug naar afzender "
"per vliegtuig`, of :guilabel:`Terug naar afzender per weg`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/bpost.rst:91
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Label Type`: choose :guilabel:`A6` or :guilabel:`A4` label sizes "
"from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Labeltype`: kies :guilabel:`A6` of :guilabel:`A4` labelformaten "
"uit het vervolgkeuzemenu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/bpost.rst:93
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Label Format`: choose :guilabel:`PDF` or :guilabel:`PNG` from the "
"drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Labelformaat`: kies :guilabel:`PDF` of :guilabel:`PNG` uit het "
"vervolgkeuzemenu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/bpost.rst:95
msgid ""
"For domestic deliveries, these features are available in "
"the :guilabel:`Options` section:"
msgstr ""
"Voor binnenlandse leveringen zijn deze functies beschikbaar in de "
"sectie :guilabel:`Opties`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/bpost.rst:97
msgid ""
"Enable the :guilabel:`Delivery on Saturday` feature to include Saturdays as "
"possible delivery dates. Depending on the :guilabel:`Bpost Package Type` "
"selected, this option might incur additional costs to the company."
msgstr ""
"Activeer de functie :guilabel:`Levering op zaterdag` om zaterdagen als "
"mogelijke leveringsdatum op te nemen. Afhankelijk van het "
"geselecteerde :guilabel:`Bpost pakkettype` kunnen hier extra kosten voor het "
"bedrijf aan verbonden zijn."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/bpost.rst:100
msgid ""
"Enable the :guilabel:`Generate Return Label` feature to automatically print "
"a return label upon validating the delivery order."
msgstr ""
"Activeer de functie :guilabel:`Genereer retourlabel` om automatisch een "
"retourlabel af te drukken bij het valideren van de leveringsorder."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/bpost.rst:103
msgid "Show Bpost shipping method."
msgstr "Toon Bpost leveringsmethode."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/cancel.rst:3
msgid "How to cancel a shipping request to a shipper?"
msgstr "Hoe annuleer je een verzendverzoek naar een vervoerder?"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/cancel.rst:6
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/label_type.rst:6
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Overzicht"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/cancel.rst:8
msgid ""
"Odoo can handle various delivery methods, including third party shippers. "
"Odoo will be linked with the transportation company tracking system."
msgstr ""
"Odoo kan verschillende leveringsmethoden afhandelen, waaronder externe "
"vervoerders. Odoo wordt gekoppeld aan het trackingsysteem van het "
"transportbedrijf."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/cancel.rst:12
msgid ""
"It will allow you to manage the transport company, the real prices and the "
"destination."
msgstr ""
"Hiermee kun je het transportbedrijf, de werkelijke prijzen en de bestemming "
"beheren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/cancel.rst:15
msgid "You can easily cancel the request made to the carrier system."
msgstr "Je kunt het verzoek aan het vervoerderssysteem eenvoudig annuleren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/cancel.rst:18
msgid "How to cancel a shipping request?"
msgstr "Hoe annuleer je een verzendverzoek?"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/cancel.rst:20
msgid ""
"If the delivery order is not **Validated**, then the request hasn't been "
"made. You can choose to cancel the delivery or to change the carrier."
