"locatie ervan."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:277
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Map` button is only visible for transfers with "
"the :guilabel:`In progress` status."
msgstr ""
"De knop :guilabel:`Kaart` is alleen zichtbaar voor verplaatsingen met de "
