msgstr "Voorbeeld van het invullen van een verzendmethode."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:122
msgid "Based on rules"
msgstr "Op basis van regels"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:124
msgid ""
"To calculate the price of shipping based on pricing rules, set "
"the :guilabel:`Provider` field to the :guilabel:`Based on Rules` option. "
"Optionally, adjust :guilabel:`Margin on Rate` and :guilabel:`Additional "
"margin` to include additional shipping costs."
msgstr ""
"Stel het veld :guilabel:`Provider` in op de optie :guilabel:`Op Basis van "
"Regels` om de verzendkosten te berekenen op basis van prijsregels. Pas "
"optioneel :guilabel:`Marge op Tarief` en :guilabel:`Extra marge` aan om "
"extra verzendkosten op te nemen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:129
msgid "Create pricing rules"
msgstr "Prijsregels maken"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:131
msgid ""
"Navigate to the :guilabel:`Pricing` tab and click :guilabel:`Add a line`. "
"Doing so opens the :guilabel:`Create Pricing Rules` window, where "
"the :guilabel:`Condition` related to the product weight, volume, price, or "
"quantity is compared to a defined amount to calculate "
"the :guilabel:`Delivery Cost`."
msgstr ""
"Ga naar het tabblad :guilabel:`Prijzen` en klik op :guilabel:`Regel "
"toevoegen`. Hierdoor wordt het venster :guilabel:`Prijsregels Aanmaken` "
"geopend, waar de :guilabel:`Voorwaarde` met betrekking tot het "
"productgewicht, volume, prijs of hoeveelheid wordt vergeleken met een "
"gedefinieerd bedrag om de :guilabel:`Leveringskosten` te berekenen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:136
msgid ""
"Once finished, click either :guilabel:`Save & New` to add another rule, "
"or :guilabel:`Save & Close`."
msgstr ""
"Klik op :guilabel:`Opslaan & Nieuw` om nog een regel toe te voegen, of "
"op :guilabel:`Opslaan & Sluiten`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:139
msgid ""
"To charge customers $20 in shipping for orders with five or fewer products, "
"set the :guilabel:`Condition` to `Quantity <= 5.00`, and "
"the :guilabel:`Delivery Cost` to `$20`."
msgstr ""
"Stel de :guilabel:`Voorwaarde` in op `Hoeveelheid <= 5.00` en "
"de :guilabel:`Leveringskosten` op `$20` om klanten $20 aan verzendkosten te "
"rekenen voor bestellingen met vijf of minder producten."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:142
msgid ""
"Display window to add a pricing rule. Set a condition and delivery cost."
msgstr ""
"Venster weergeven om een prijsregel toe te voegen. Stel een voorwaarde en "
"leveringskosten in."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:145
msgid ""
"To restrict shipping to specific destinations on the **eCommerce** website, "
"in the shipping method form, navigate to the :guilabel:`Destination "
"Availability` tab and define the :guilabel:`Countries`, :guilabel:`States`, "
"and :guilabel:`Zip Prefixes`. Leave these fields empty if all locations "
"apply."
msgstr ""
"Ga in het verzendmethodeformulier naar het "
"tabblad :guilabel:`Bestemmingsbeschikbaarheid` en definieer "
"de :guilabel:`Landen`, :guilabel:`Staten` en :guilabel:`Postcodeprefixen` om "
"verzending naar specifieke bestemmingen op de **E-commerce** website te "
"beperken. Laat deze velden leeg als alle locaties van toepassing zijn."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:152
msgid "Calculate delivery cost"
msgstr "Leveringskosten berekenen"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:154
msgid ""
"Shipping cost is the :guilabel:`Delivery cost` specified in the rule that "
"satisfies the :guilabel:`Condition`, plus any extra charges from "
"the :guilabel:`Margin on rate` and :guilabel:`Additional margin`."
msgstr ""
"Verzendkosten zijn de :guilabel:`leveringskosten` die in de regel zijn "
"opgegeven die voldoet aan de :guilabel:`Voorwaarde`, plus eventuele extra "
"kosten uit de :guilabel:`Marge op tarief` en :guilabel:`Extra marge`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:158
msgid ""
"Total = Rule's~Delivery~Cost + (Margin~on~rate \\times Rule's~Delivery~Cost) "
"+ Additional~margin\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Totaal = Regel's~leveringskosten + (Marge~op~tarief \\times "
"Regel's~leveringskosten) + Extra~marge\n"
"\n"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:162
