msgstr ""
"Het configureren van meerdere routes per verzendmethode is nuttig voor het "
"aanpassen van magazijnleveringsprocessen op basis van:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:187
msgid ""
"speed (e.g., use :doc:`one-step delivery <../daily_operations/"
"receipts_delivery_one_step>` for express shipping, or :doc:`two-step <../"
"daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps>` for standard shipping)."
msgstr ""
"snelheid (bv. gebruik :doc:`levering in één stap <../daily_operations/"
"receipts_delivery_one_step>` voor expresverzending, of :doc:`twee stappen "
