"to install it."
msgstr ""
"Nadat de Starshipit-rekening is ingesteld, integreer deze met de Odoo-"
"database. Ga hiervoor naar Odoo's :guilabel:`Apps`-module, zoek naar "
"de :guilabel:`Starshipit vervoerder`-module en klik op :guilabel:`Activeren` "
"om deze te installeren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:99
msgid "Starshipit Shipping module in the Odoo Apps module."
msgstr "Starshipit vervoerder-module in de Odoo Apps-module."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:104
msgid "Configure a Starshipit delivery method"
msgstr "Configureer een Starshipit-leveringsmethode"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:106
msgid ""
"Once installed, activate the feature by going to :menuselection:`Inventory --"
"> Configuration --> Settings`. Under the :guilabel:`Shipping Connectors` "
"section, activate the :guilabel:`Starshipit Connector` option."
msgstr ""
"Activeer de functie na installatie door naar :menuselection:`Voorraad --> "
"Configuratie --> Instellingen` te gaan. Activeer onder het "
"gedeelte :guilabel:`Verzendconnectors` de optie :guilabel:`Starshipit-"
"connector`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:110
msgid ""
"After activating :guilabel:`Starshipit Connector`, click "
"the :guilabel:`Starshipit Shipping Methods` link below the listed connector. "
"Once on the :guilabel:`Delivery Methods` page, click :guilabel:`Create`."
msgstr ""
"Klik na het activeren van :guilabel:`Starshipit Connector` op de "
"link :guilabel:`Starshipit Shipping Methods` onder de vermelde connector. "
"Klik op de pagina :guilabel:`Leveringsmethoden` op :guilabel:`Aanmaken`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:115
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Delivery Methods` can also be accessed by going "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> Delivery --> Delivery "
"Methods`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Leveringsmethoden` zijn ook toegankelijk "
"via :menuselection:`Voorraad --> Configuratie --> Levering --> "
"Leveringsmethoden`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:118
msgid ""
"Configure a Starshipit delivery method in Odoo by filling out the fields on "
"the :guilabel:`Delivery Methods` form as follows:"
msgstr ""
"Configureer een Starshipit-leveringsmethode in Odoo door de velden op het "
"formulier :guilabel:`Leveringsmethoden` als volgt in te vullen:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:121
msgid ":guilabel:`Delivery Method`: type `Starshipit`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Leveringsmethode`: typ `Starshipit`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:122
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Provider`: select :guilabel:`Starshipit` from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Provider`: selecteer :guilabel:`Starshipit` uit het "
"vervolgkeuzemenu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:123
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Delivery Product`: assign or create the delivery product that "
"will appear on the sales order line when the cost of shipping is computed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Leveringsproduct`: wijs het leveringsproduct toe of maak het aan "
"dat op de verkooporderregel verschijnt wanneer de verzendkosten worden "
"berekend."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:127
msgid ""
"The fields discussed in this section are specific to configuring Starshipit. "
"For more information about the other fields, refer to :doc:`../"
"setup_configuration`."
msgstr ""
"De velden die in dit gedeelte worden besproken, zijn specifiek voor het "
"configureren van Starshipit. Raadpleeg :doc:`../setup_configuration` voor "
"meer informatie over de andere velden."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:130
msgid "In the :guilabel:`Starshipit Configuration` tab, fill out these fields:"
msgstr ""
"Vul in het tabblad :guilabel:`Starshipit-configuratie` de volgende velden in:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:132
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Starshipit API Key`: enter the :abbr:`API (Application "
"Programming Interface)` key :ref:`obtained from Starshipit <inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/star-api>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Starshipit API-sleutel`: voer de :abbr:`API-sleutel (Application "
"Programming Interface)` in die :ref:`van Starshipit is verkregen <inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/star-api>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:134
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Starshipit Subscription Key`: enter the subscription key obtained "
"from the same place as the :ref:`API key <inventory/shipping_receiving/star-"
"api>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Starshipit-abonnementssleutel`: voer de abonnementssleutel in die "
"op dezelfde plaats is verkregen als de :ref:`API-sleutel <inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/star-api>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:136
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Origin Address`: Enter the address where products are shipped "
"from. This field is crucial for calculating shipping rates "
"and :ref:`generating shipping labels <inventory/shipping_receiving/star-"
"label>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Herkomstadres`: voer het adres in van waaruit producten worden "
"verzonden. Dit veld is essentieel voor het berekenen van verzendtarieven "
"en :ref:`het genereren van verzendlabels <inventory/shipping_receiving/star-"
"label>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:139
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Default Package Type`: Set a default package type to include the "
"weight of the empty package when automatically calculating shipping rates."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Standaard pakkettype`: stel een standaard pakkettype in om het "
"gewicht van het lege pakket op te nemen bij het automatisch berekenen van "
"verzendtarieven."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:143
msgid ""
"To set a default package type, the *Packages* feature **must** be enabled "
"in :menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> Settings`."
msgstr ""
"Om een standaard pakkettype in te stellen, **moet** de functie *Pakketten* "
"zijn ingeschakeld in :menuselection:`Voorraad --> Configuratie --> "
"Instellingen`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:146
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-cloud-upload` :guilabel:`(Save manually)` icon at the "
"top of the page to save the changes."
msgstr ""
"Klik op het icoon :icon:`fa-cloud-upload` :guilabel:`(Handmatig opslaan)` "
"bovenaan de pagina om de wijzigingen op te slaan."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:148
msgid ""
"To load the newly configured shipping products, click :guilabel:`Select a "
"service linked to your starshipit account` at the bottom of "
"the :guilabel:`Starshipit Configuration` tab, and a :guilabel:`Choose "
"Starshipit Shipping Service` pop-up window appears. In "
"the :guilabel:`Delivery Service` field, select the desired shipping service "
"for deliveries and returns from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"Klik op :guilabel:`Selecteer een dienst gekoppeld aan je starshipit-account` "
"onderaan het tabblad :guilabel:`Starshipit Configuration` om de nieuw "
"geconfigureerde verzendproducten te laden. Er verschijnt een pop-"
"upvenster :guilabel:`Choose Starshipit Shipping Service`. Selecteer in het "
"veld :guilabel:`Delivery Service` de gewenste verzenddienst voor leveringen "
"en retouren uit het vervolgkeuzemenu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:154
msgid ""
"The list of services shown during initial configuration may be incomplete. "
"Starshipit determines service availability based on shipment details such as "
"the destination address and package weight, which are not yet available at "
"this stage. To select from the full list of services available for a "
"specific order, use the :guilabel:`Get more delivery methods` option "
"directly from the sales order. See :ref:`inventory/shipping_receiving/star-"
"label` for details."
msgstr ""
"De lijst met diensten die tijdens de eerste configuratie wordt getoond, kan "
"onvolledig zijn. Starshipit bepaalt de beschikbaarheid van diensten op basis "
"van verzendgegevens zoals het bestemmingsadres en het pakketgewicht, die in "
"dit stadium nog niet beschikbaar zijn. Gebruik de optie :guilabel:`Get more "
"delivery methods` rechtstreeks vanuit de verkooporder om te kiezen uit de "
"volledige lijst met diensten die beschikbaar zijn voor een specifieke order. "
"Zie :ref:`inventory/shipping_receiving/star-label` voor details."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:160
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Confirm` and the selected delivery service populates in "
"the :guilabel:`Shipping Method` and :guilabel:`Starshipit Service Code` "
"fields."
msgstr ""
"Klik op :guilabel:`Bevestigen` en de geselecteerde leveringsdienst wordt "
"ingevuld in de velden :guilabel:`Shipping Method` en :guilabel:`Starshipit "
"Service Code`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:163
msgid "Sample of a Starshipit shipping product configured in Odoo:"
msgstr ""
"Voorbeeld van een Starshipit-verzendproduct dat in Odoo is geconfigureerd:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:0
msgid ":guilabel:`Sendle: Sendle drop off`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Sendle: Sendle-aflevering`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:0
msgid ":guilabel:`Shipping Product`: `Sendle Delivery`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Verzendproduct`: `Sendle Delivery`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:0
msgid ":guilabel:`Starshipit Service Code`: `STANDARD-DROPOFF`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Starshipit-servicecode`: `STANDARD-DROPOFF`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:174
msgid ""
"Starshipit does not provide test keys when a company tests the sending of a "
"package in Odoo. This means that if a package is created, the account may be "
"charged."
msgstr ""
"Starshipit biedt geen testsleutels wanneer een bedrijf het verzenden van een "
"pakket in Odoo test. Dit betekent dat als een pakket wordt aangemaakt, de "
"rekening mogelijk in rekening wordt gebracht."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:177
msgid ""
"Odoo has a built-in layer of protection against unwanted charges when using "
"test environments. Within a test environment, if a shipping method is used "
"to create labels, then those labels are immediately cancelled after creation "
"— this occurs automatically. Please note that depending on the shipping "
"provider being used, the account might be charged for printing label, unless "
"the order is cancelled manually on the couriers’s portal."
msgstr ""
"Odoo heeft een ingebouwde beschermingslaag tegen ongewenste kosten bij het "
"gebruik van testomgevingen. Binnen een testomgeving worden labels die met "
"een verzendmethode worden aangemaakt, automatisch geannuleerd na het "
"aanmaken. Houd er rekening mee dat afhankelijk van de gebruikte provider de "
"rekening mogelijk in rekening wordt gebracht voor het afdrukken van labels, "
"tenzij de bestelling handmatig wordt geannuleerd op het portal van de "
"vervoerder."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:184
msgid ""
"Switch between the test and production environment by clicking "
"the :guilabel:`Environment` smart button at the top of the shipping method "
"form."
msgstr ""
"Schakel tussen de test- en productieomgeving door op de slimme "
"knop :guilabel:`Omgeving` bovenaan het verzendmethodeformulier te klikken."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:190
msgid "Generate a label with Starshipit"
msgstr "Genereer een label met Starshipit"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:192
msgid ""
"When creating a quotation in Odoo, add the Starshipit shipping method by "
"clicking the :guilabel:`Add shipping` button."
msgstr ""
"Voeg bij het aanmaken van een offerte in Odoo de Starshipit-verzendmethode "
"toe door op de knop :guilabel:`Verzending toevoegen` te klikken."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:196
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Add a shipping method` pop-up window, select a Starshipit "
"shipping method in the :guilabel:`Shipping Method` field."
msgstr ""
"Selecteer in het pop-upvenster :guilabel:`Voeg een verzendmethode toe` een "
"Starshipit verzendmethode in het veld :guilabel:`Verzendmethode`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:199
msgid ""
"If the desired service is not available, click :guilabel:`Get more delivery "
"methods`. This sends the actual order details (including the destination "
"address, weight, and volume) to Starshipit, which returns the complete list "
"of services available for that specific shipment. A new Starshipit delivery "
"method is then created automatically and selected in the :guilabel:`Shipping "
"Method` field."
msgstr ""
"Als de gewenste dienst niet beschikbaar is, klik op :guilabel:`Meer "
"leveringsmethoden ophalen`. Dit stuurt de daadwerkelijke ordergegevens "
"(inclusief het bestemmingsadres, gewicht en volume) naar Starshipit, dat de "
"volledige lijst van diensten retourneert die beschikbaar zijn voor die "
"specifieke zending. Een nieuwe Starshipit leveringsmethode wordt dan "
"automatisch aangemaakt en geselecteerd in het "
"veld :guilabel:`Verzendmethode`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:204
msgid ""
"Calculate the shipping rate by clicking :guilabel:`Get rate`. Finally, "
"click :guilabel:`Add` to include the cost of shipping to the sales order "
"line, labeled as the *delivery product*."
msgstr ""
"Bereken het verzendtarief door op :guilabel:`Tarief ophalen` te klikken. "
"Klik ten slotte op :guilabel:`Toevoegen` om de verzendkosten toe te voegen "
"aan de verkooporderregel, aangeduid als het *leveringsproduct*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:209
msgid ""
"Automatically calculate shipping costs for Starshipit in **both** Odoo "
"*Sales* and *eCommerce* applications."
msgstr ""
"Bereken verzendkosten voor Starshipit automatisch in **zowel** de Odoo-"
"applicaties *Verkoop* als *E-commerce*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:216
msgid ":guilabel:`Tracking number(s)` if the selected courier supports it."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Tracking nummer(s)` als de geselecteerde vervoerder dit "
"ondersteunt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:217
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Return label(s)` if the Starshipit connector is configured for "
"returns."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Aangifte label(s)` als de Starshipit-connector is geconfigureerd "
"voor aangiftes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:219
msgid "Example of a shipped order in Odoo."
msgstr "Voorbeeld van een verzonden bestelling in Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:224
msgid ""
"Package weight in Odoo is calculated by adding the weights of the products "
"plus the empty package saved in the database. Ensure the correct shipping "
"option is selected, as the package weight is not automatically verified."
msgstr ""
"Pakketgewicht in Odoo wordt berekend door de gewichten van de producten op "
"te tellen bij het lege pakket dat is opgeslagen in de database. Zorg ervoor "
"dat de juiste verzendoptie is geselecteerd, aangezien het pakketgewicht niet "
"automatisch wordt geverifieerd."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:228
msgid ""
"Verify the destination address, as Starshipit checks it when the order is "
"created."
msgstr ""
"Controleer het bestemmingsadres, aangezien Starshipit dit controleert "
"wanneer de bestelling wordt aangemaakt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:230
msgid ""
"Finally, some couriers may require other information, such as an email "
"address or phone number. Please ensure that all necessary information are "
"set upon sending a shipping order."
msgstr ""
"Tot slot kunnen sommige vervoerders andere informatie vereisen, zoals een e-"
"mailadres of telefoonnummer. Zorg ervoor dat alle benodigde informatie is "
"ingesteld bij het verzenden van een verzendorder."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:234
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "Retouren"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:236
msgid "Starshipit allows returns with the following couriers:"
msgstr "Starshipit staat aangiftes toe met de volgende vervoerders:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:237
msgid "Australia Post eParcel"
msgstr "Australia Post eParcel"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:238
msgid "TNT"
msgstr "TNT"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:239
msgid "Couriers Please"
msgstr "Couriers Please"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:240
msgid "Aramex"
msgstr "Aramex"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:241
msgid "StarTrack"
msgstr "StarTrack"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:242
msgid "DHL Express"
msgstr "DHL Express"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:243
msgid "NZ Post Domestic"
msgstr "NZ Post Domestic"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:245
msgid ""
"This can be done by clicking the :guilabel:`Return` smart button on the "
"intended delivery order. If the selected courier supports returns, "
"the :guilabel:`Print Return Label` button will be available."
msgstr ""
"Dit kan door te klikken op de slimme knop :guilabel:`Inleveren` bij de "
"betreffende leveringsorder. Als de geselecteerde vervoerder aangiftes "
"ondersteunt, is de knop :guilabel:`Aangiftelabel afdrukken` beschikbaar."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:252
msgid ""
"If a delivery order is cancelled in Odoo, it will be automatically archived "
"in Starshipit. However, the cancellation will not be sent to the courier "
"itself, so make sure to log onto the courier's platform to handle the "
"cancellation manually."
msgstr ""
"Als een leveringsorder wordt geannuleerd in Odoo, wordt deze automatisch "
"gearchiveerd in Starshipit. De annulering wordt echter niet naar de "
"vervoerder zelf gestuurd, dus zorg ervoor dat je inlogt op het platform van "
"de vervoerder om de annulering handmatig af te handelen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/third_party_shipper.rst:3
msgid "Third-party shipping carriers"
msgstr "Externe verzendvervoerders"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/third_party_shipper.rst:10
msgid ""
"Users can link third-party shipping carriers to Odoo databases, in order to "
"verify carriers' delivery to specific addresses, :doc:`automatically "
"calculate shipping costs <../setup_configuration>`, and :doc:`generate "
"shipping labels <labels>`."
msgstr ""
"Gebruikers kunnen externe verzendvervoerders koppelen aan Odoo-databases om "
"de levering van vervoerders naar specifieke adressen te "
"verifiëren, :doc:`verzendkosten automatisch te berekenen <../"
"setup_configuration>` en :doc:`verzendlabels te genereren <labels>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/third_party_shipper.rst:14
msgid ""
"In Odoo, shipping carriers can be applied to a sales order (SO), invoice, or "
"delivery order. For tips on resolving common issues when configuring "
"shipping connectors, skip to the :ref:`Troubleshooting <inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/third-party-troubles>` section."
msgstr ""
"In Odoo kunnen vervoerders worden toegepast op een verkooporder, "
"verkoopfactuur of leveringsorder. Voor tips over het oplossen van "
"veelvoorkomende problemen bij het configureren van verzendconnectoren, ga "
"naar het gedeelte :ref:`Probleemoplossing <inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"third-party-troubles>`."

