":ref:`Installeer de verzendconnector <inventory/shipping_receiving/shipping-"
"connector>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/third_party_shipper.rst:64
msgid ""
":ref:`Set up delivery method <inventory/shipping_receiving/configure-"
