#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/ups_credentials.rst:170
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Shipping Methods` page, click the :guilabel:`New` button."
msgstr ""
"Klik op de pagina :guilabel:`Verzendmethoden` op de knop :guilabel:`Nieuw`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/ups_credentials.rst:173
msgid ""
"For existing UPS shipping methods whose :guilabel:`Provider` "
"is :guilabel:`UPS Legacy`, archive it and create a new shipping method "
"using :guilabel:`UPS`."
msgstr ""
"Archiveer voor bestaande UPS-verzendmethoden waarvan "
"de :guilabel:`Provider` :guilabel:`UPS Legacy` is en maak een nieuwe "
"verzendmethode aan met :guilabel:`UPS`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/ups_credentials.rst:176
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Provider` field, select :guilabel:`UPS`. Doing so reveals "
"the :guilabel:`UPS Configuration` tab, where various fields must be entered. "
"For details instructions on configuring the other fields on the shipping "
"method, refer to the :doc:`Configure third-party carrier "
"<third_party_shipper>` documentation."
msgstr ""
"Selecteer in het veld :guilabel:`Provider` de optie :guilabel:`UPS`. "
"Hierdoor verschijnt het tabblad :guilabel:`UPS-configuratie`, waar "
"verschillende velden moeten worden ingevuld. Raadpleeg de "
"documentatie :doc:`Vervoerder van derden configureren <third_party_shipper>` "
"voor gedetailleerde instructies over het configureren van de andere velden "
"op de verzendmethode."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/ups_credentials.rst:181
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`UPS Configuration` tab, complete the following fields:"
