#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/ups_credentials.rst:189
msgid ""
":guilabel:`UPS Service Type`: Select from the drop-down menu the type of "
"shipping service."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`UPS-servicetype`: Selecteer in het vervolgkeuzemenu het type "
"verzendservice."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/ups_credentials.rst:190
msgid ""
":guilabel:`UPS Package Type`: (*required*) Select from the drop-down menu "
"the :doc:`package type <../../product_management/configure/package>` that is "
"supported for the shipping service."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`UPS-pakkettype`: (*verplicht*) Selecteer in het vervolgkeuzemenu "
"het :doc:`pakkettype <../../product_management/configure/package>` dat wordt "
"ondersteund voor de verzendservice."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/ups_credentials.rst:192
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Package Weight Unit`: The unit of measure for the package weight."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Pakketeenheid (gewicht)`: De maateenheid voor het pakketgewicht."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/ups_credentials.rst:193
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Package Size Unit`: The unit of measure for the package "
"dimensions."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Pakketeenheid (afmetingen)`: De maateenheid voor de "
"pakketafmetingen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/ups_credentials.rst:194
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Label Format`: Choose the label format shipping "
"labels: :guilabel:`PDF`, :guilabel:`ZPL`, :guilabel:`EPL`, "
"or :guilabel:`SPL`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Labelformaat`: Kies het labelformaat voor "
"verzendlabels: :guilabel:`pdf`, :guilabel:`ZPL`, :guilabel:`EPL` "
"of :guilabel:`SPL`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/ups_credentials.rst:197
msgid "Show the \"UPS Configuration\" tab on the Shipping Methods form."
msgstr ""
"Toon het tabblad \"UPS-configuratie\" op het formulier Verzendmethoden."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/ups_credentials.rst:201
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Options` section, the following features are available:"
msgstr "In de sectie :guilabel:`Opties` zijn de volgende functies beschikbaar:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/ups_credentials.rst:203
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Bill My Account`: Charge the user's UPS account for shipping in "
"the *eCommerce* app."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Mijn rekening belasten`: Bereken de verzendkosten op de UPS-"
"rekening van de gebruiker in de *E-commerce*-app."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/ups_credentials.rst:204
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Collect on Delivery`: Collect payment from customers for shipping "
"after the shipment is delivered."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Rembours`: Innen betaling van klanten voor verzending nadat de "
"zending is afgeleverd."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/ups_credentials.rst:206
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Generate Return Label`: Print the return label for the order "
"after the delivery order is validated."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Inleverlabel genereren`: Druk het inleverlabel voor de bestelling "
"af nadat de leveringsorder is gevalideerd."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/ups_credentials.rst:208
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Duties paid by`: Select whether duties or other fees are charged "
"to the :guilabel:`Sender` or :guilabel:`Recipient` of the order."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Rechten betaald door`: Selecteer of rechten of andere kosten in "
"rekening worden gebracht aan de :guilabel:`Verzender` "
"of :guilabel:`Ontvanger` van de bestelling."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/usps.rst:3
msgid "USPS integration"
msgstr "USPS-integratie"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/usps.rst:7
msgid ""
"Integrating a USPS account with Odoo's **Inventory** app makes it possible "
"to calculate delivery rates and generate delivery labels within Odoo. This "
"is accomplished by enabling the USPS shipping connector, then configuring at "
"least one delivery method."
msgstr ""
"Het integreren van een USPS-rekening met de **Voorraad**-app van Odoo maakt "
"het mogelijk om verzendtarieven te berekenen en verzendlabels binnen Odoo te "
"genereren. Dit wordt bereikt door de USPS-verzendconnector in te schakelen "
"en vervolgens ten minste één leveringsmethode te configureren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/usps.rst:14
msgid ""
"To enable the USPS shipping connector, open the :menuselection:`Apps` app "
"from the main Odoo dashboard. In the :guilabel:`Search` field, search for "
"`USPS`  and click :guilabel:`Install`."
msgstr ""
"Om de USPS verzendconnector in te schakelen, open je "
"de :menuselection:`Apps`-app vanaf het Odoo-hoofddashboard. Zoek in "
"het :guilabel:`Zoeken`-veld naar `USPS` en klik op :guilabel:`Installeren`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/usps.rst:17
msgid ""
"After the shipping connector is installed, the USPS connector is enabled by "
"default."
msgstr ""
"Nadat de verzendconnector is geïnstalleerd, is de USPS-connector standaard "
"ingeschakeld."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/usps.rst:20
msgid "Configure USPS business account"
msgstr "USPS-zakelijke rekening configureren"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/usps.rst:22
msgid ""
"A USPS business account is required to obtain the information needed "
"to :ref:`fill out the fields in the delivery method form <inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/usps-configuration>`. To create a new account, navigate "
"to USPS's `Create Your USPS.com Account <https://reg.usps.com/entreg/"
"RegistrationAction_input>`_ page, select the :guilabel:`Business Account` "
"option, then follow the steps."
msgstr ""
"Een USPS-zakelijke rekening is vereist om de informatie te verkrijgen die "
"nodig is om :ref:`de velden in het leveringsmethodeformulier in te vullen "
"<inventory/shipping_receiving/usps-configuration>`. Om een nieuwe rekening "
"aan te maken, ga je naar de pagina `Create Your USPS.com Account <https://"
"reg.usps.com/entreg/RegistrationAction_input>`_ van USPS, selecteer je de "
"optie :guilabel:`Business Account` en volg je de stappen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/usps.rst:29
msgid "Create a developer app"
msgstr "Ontwikkelaarsapp maken"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/usps.rst:31
msgid ""
"After the USPS Business Customer Onboarding Portal (COP) is set up, `sign in "
"to the USPS COP <https://cop.usps.com/>`_ to manage business account "
"information and access the USPS APIs."
msgstr ""
"Nadat de USPS Business Customer Onboarding Portal (COP) is ingesteld, `log "
"je in op de USPS COP <https://cop.usps.com/>`_ om zakelijke rekeninggegevens "
"te beheren en toegang te krijgen tot de USPS API's."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/usps.rst:34
msgid ""
"On this page, make note of the :guilabel:`Customer Registration ID (CRID)`, "
"the :guilabel:`Master Mailer ID`, and the :guilabel:`Label Mailer ID`."
msgstr ""
"Noteer op deze pagina de :guilabel:`Customer Registration ID (CRID)`, "
"de :guilabel:`Master Mailer ID` en de :guilabel:`Label Mailer ID`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/usps.rst:37
msgid "Click the :guilabel:`My Apps` link at the top of the screen."
msgstr "Klik op de link :guilabel:`My Apps` bovenaan het scherm."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/usps.rst:39
msgid ""
"Open the :guilabel:`Developer Apps` tab. Click the :guilabel:`Add App` "
"button. In the *Add App* pop-up window, specify an :guilabel:`App Name`. "
"Select the APIs to use. Finally, click the :guilabel:`Add App` button."
msgstr ""
"Open het tabblad :guilabel:`Developer Apps`. Klik op de knop :guilabel:`Add "
"App`. Geef in het pop-upvenster *Add App* een :guilabel:`App Name` op. "
"Selecteer de te gebruiken API's. Klik ten slotte op de knop :guilabel:`Add "
"App`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/usps.rst:43
msgid ""
"A window opens, titled after the app name. Keep this window open as the "
"delivery method is configured. The :guilabel:`Consumer Key` "
"and :guilabel:`Consumer Secret` will be necessary in the delivery method "
"form."
msgstr ""
"Er opent een venster met de naam van de app als titel. Houd dit venster open "
"terwijl de leveringsmethode wordt geconfigureerd. De :guilabel:`Consumer "
"Key` en het :guilabel:`Consumer Secret` zijn nodig in het "
"leveringsmethodeformulier."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/usps.rst:50
msgid ""
"Once the USPS shipping connector is enabled, at least one delivery method "
"must be configured. After doing so, the delivery method can be included in "
"sales orders (SOs) and used to compute delivery costs and print shipping "
"labels."
msgstr ""
"Zodra de USPS verzendconnector is ingeschakeld, moet minimaal één "
"leveringsmethode worden geconfigureerd. Daarna kan de leveringsmethode "
"worden opgenomen in verkooporders (SO's) en worden gebruikt om "
"leveringskosten te berekenen en verzendlabels af te drukken."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/usps.rst:55
msgid ""
"The USPS shipping connector automatically creates two default delivery "
"methods: :guilabel:`USPS Domestic` and :guilabel:`USPS International`. These "
"methods are preconfigured with test credentials, allowing them to be used "
"for testing purposes."
msgstr ""
"De USPS verzendconnector maakt automatisch twee standaard leveringsmethoden "
"aan: :guilabel:`USPS Domestic` en :guilabel:`USPS International`. Deze "
"methoden zijn vooraf geconfigureerd met testgegevens, waardoor ze voor "
"testdoeleinden kunnen worden gebruikt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/usps.rst:59
msgid ""
"To create actual shipments using the default delivery methods, the test "
"credentials must be replaced with credentials from a valid USPS account."
msgstr ""
"Om werkelijke zendingen te maken met behulp van de standaard "
"leveringsmethoden, moeten de testgegevens worden vervangen door gegevens van "
"een geldige USPS-rekening."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/usps.rst:62
msgid ""
"Open or create a new delivery method. Navigate to :menuselection:`Inventory "
"--> Configuration --> Delivery Methods`, then open an existing USPS delivery "
"method to display its form. Alternatively, click :guilabel:`New` to open a "
"blank form and configure a new delivery method."
msgstr ""
"Open of maak een nieuwe leveringsmethode. Ga naar :menuselection:`Voorraad --"
"> Configuratie --> Leveringsmethoden` en open vervolgens een bestaande USPS-"
"leveringsmethode om het formulier weer te geven. Je kunt ook "
"op :guilabel:`Nieuw` klikken om een leeg formulier te openen en een nieuwe "
"leveringsmethode te configureren."

