"To rotate elements in |ZPL|, begin by navigating to the :ref:`ZPL code of "
"the label <inventory/shipping_receiving/zpl-view>` in "
"the :guilabel:`Architecture` tab."
msgstr ""
"Navigeer eerst naar de :ref:`ZPL-code van het label <inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/zpl-view>` op het tabblad :guilabel:`Architectuur` om "
"elementen in |ZPL| te roteren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/zebra.rst:190
