#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/manufacturing_work_orders.rst:40
msgid "Create a manufacturing order"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/manufacturing_work_orders.rst:42
msgid ""
"To manufacture a product in Odoo **Manufacturing**, begin by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Operations --> Manufacturing "
"Orders`, then click :guilabel:`New` to create a new |MO|."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/manufacturing_work_orders.rst:46
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/one_step_manufacturing.rst:38
msgid ""
"On the new |MO|, select the product to be produced from "
"the :guilabel:`Product` drop-down menu. The :guilabel:`Bill of Material` "
"field auto-populates with the associated bill of materials (BoM)."
msgstr ""
"Selecteer op de nieuwe |MO| het te produceren product uit het "
"vervolgkeuzemenu :guilabel:`Product`. Het veld :guilabel:`Stuklijst` wordt "
"automatisch ingevuld met de bijbehorende stuklijst."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/manufacturing_work_orders.rst:49
msgid "Specify the :guilabel:`Quantity` of the product to be produced."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/manufacturing_work_orders.rst:51
msgid ""
"If a product has more than one |BoM| configured for it, the specific |BoM| "
"can be selected in the :guilabel:`Bill of Material` field, and "
"the :guilabel:`Product` field auto-populates with the associated product."
msgstr ""
"Als er voor een product meer dan één |BOM| is geconfigureerd, kan de "
"specifieke |BOM| worden geselecteerd in het veld :guilabel:`Stuklijst` en "
"wordt het veld :guilabel:`Product` automatisch ingevuld met het bijbehorende "
"product."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/manufacturing_work_orders.rst:55
msgid ""
"After a |BoM| is selected, the *Components* and *Work Orders* tabs auto-"
"populate with the components and operations specified on the |BoM|. If "
"additional components or operations are required for the |MO|, add them to "
"the *Components* and *Work Orders* tabs by clicking :guilabel:`Add a line`."
msgstr ""
"Nadat een |BoM| is geselecteerd, worden de tabbladen *Componenten* en "
"*Werkorders* automatisch ingevuld met de componenten en bewerkingen die op "
"de |BoM| zijn gespecificeerd. Als er extra componenten of bewerkingen nodig "
"zijn voor de |MO|, voeg deze dan toe aan de tabbladen *Componenten* en "
"*Werkorders* door op :guilabel:`Een regel toevoegen`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/manufacturing_work_orders.rst:59
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/one_step_manufacturing.rst:50
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:48
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing.rst:48
msgid "Finally, click :guilabel:`Confirm` to confirm the |MO|."
msgstr "Klik ten slotte op :guilabel:`Bevestigen` om de |MO| te bevestigen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/manufacturing_work_orders.rst:64
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/one_step_manufacturing.rst:53
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:74
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing.rst:70
msgid "Process manufacturing order"
msgstr "Productieorder verwerken"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/manufacturing_work_orders.rst:66
msgid ""
"An |MO| is processed by completing all of the work orders listed under its "
"*Work Orders* tab. This can be done on the |MO| itself or from the *Shop "
"Floor* module."
msgstr ""
"Een |MO| wordt verwerkt door alle werkorders te voltooien die onder het "
"tabblad *Werkorders* staan. Dit kan op de |MO| zelf of via de module "
"*Werkvloer* gebeuren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/manufacturing_work_orders.rst:72
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/one_step_manufacturing.rst:59
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:80
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing.rst:76
msgid "Basic workflow"
msgstr "Basisprocedure"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/manufacturing_work_orders.rst:74
msgid ""
"Work orders can be completed from the :ref:`Work Orders tab <manufacturing/"
"basic_setup/process-wo-from-mo>` or a :ref:`work order form <manufacturing/"
"basic_setup/process-wo-from-wo>`."
msgstr ""
"Werkorders kunnen worden voltooid via het :ref:`tabblad Werkorders "
"<manufacturing/basic_setup/process-wo-from-mo>` of een "
":ref:`werkorderformulier <manufacturing/basic_setup/process-wo-from-wo>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/manufacturing_work_orders.rst:81
msgid "Work Orders tab"
msgstr "tabblad Werkorders"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/manufacturing_work_orders.rst:83
msgid ""
"To complete work orders from the |MO| itself, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Operations --> Manufacturing "
"Orders`, then select an |MO|."
msgstr ""
"Om werkorders vanaf de |MO| zelf te voltooien, navigeer naar "
":menuselection:`Productie-app --> Bewerkingen --> Productieorders` en "
"selecteer vervolgens een |MO|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/manufacturing_work_orders.rst:86
msgid ""
"On the |MO| form, open the *Work Orders* tab. When work begins on the first "
"work order that needs to be completed, click the :icon:`fa-"
"play` :guilabel:`(Start)` button for that work order. Odoo **Manufacturing** "
"then starts a timer that tracks how long the work order takes to complete."
msgstr ""
"Open op het |MO| formulier het tabblad *Werkorders*. Klik, wanneer het werk "
"begint aan de eerste werkorder die voltooid moet worden, op de :icon:`fa-"
"play` :guilabel:`(Start)` knop voor die werkorder. Odoo **Productie** start "
"vervolgens een timer die bijhoudt hoe lang het duurt om de werkorder te "
"voltooien."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/manufacturing_work_orders.rst:90
msgid "Click the Start button to start work on a work order."
msgstr "Klik op de Start-knop om met een werkorder te beginnen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/manufacturing_work_orders.rst:93
msgid ""
"When the work order is completed, click the :icon:`fa-"
"check` :guilabel:`(Done)` button for that work order. Repeat the same "
"process for each work order listed in the *Work Orders* tab."
msgstr ""
"Klik, wanneer de werkorder is voltooid, op de :icon:`fa-check` :guilabel:`"
"(Gereed)` knop voor die werkorder. Herhaal hetzelfde proces voor elke "
"werkorder die op het tabblad *Werkorders* staat."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/manufacturing_work_orders.rst:96
msgid "Click the Done button to complete work on a work order."
msgstr "Klik op de Gereed-knop om een werkorder te voltooien."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/manufacturing_work_orders.rst:99
msgid ""
"After all work orders are complete, :ref:`complete the MO <manufacturing/"
"basic_setup/complete-mo>`."
msgstr ""
"Nadat alle werkorders zijn voltooid, :ref:`voltooi de productieorder "
"<manufacturing/basic_setup/complete-mo>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/manufacturing_work_orders.rst:104
msgid "Work order form"
msgstr "werkorderformulier"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/manufacturing_work_orders.rst:106
msgid ""
"To process work orders from their forms, open the *Work Orders* page by "
"navigating to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Operations --> Work "
"Orders`. A list of work orders displays. Choose a work order from the list. "
"The work order form opens."
msgstr ""
"Om werkorders via hun formulier te verwerken, open je de pagina *Werkorders* "
"door te navigeren naar :menuselection:`Productie-app --> Bewerkingen --> "
"Werkorders`. Er verschijnt een lijst met werkorders. Kies een werkorder uit "
"de lijst. Het werkorderformulier opent."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/manufacturing_work_orders.rst:110
msgid ""
"In the top corner of the form, the status of the work order is displayed. "
"When changing the status from :guilabel:`To Do` to :guilabel:`In Progress`, "
"a new :guilabel:`Time Tracking` entry is created. The :guilabel:`Planned "
"Date` updates to the current date and time, with the end time based on "
"the :guilabel:`Expected Duration`."
msgstr ""
"In de bovenhoek van het formulier wordt de status van de werkorder "
"weergegeven. Wanneer je de status wijzigt van :guilabel:`Te doen` naar "
":guilabel:`In uitvoering`, wordt een nieuw :guilabel:`Tijdsregistratie` item "
"aangemaakt. De :guilabel:`Geplande datum` wordt bijgewerkt naar de huidige "
"datum en tijd, waarbij de eindtijd gebaseerd is op de :guilabel:`Verwachte "
"duur`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/manufacturing_work_orders.rst:115
msgid ""
"Work on a work order can be split into different :guilabel:`Time Tracking` "
"entries. To end an entry and pause work, change the status of the work order "
"to :guilabel:`To Do`. Then, to add a new entry and begin work, change the "
"status of the work order back to :guilabel:`In Progress`."
msgstr ""
"Werk aan een werkorder kan worden opgesplitst in verschillende "
":guilabel:`Tijdsregistratie` items. Om een item te beëindigen en het werk te "
"pauzeren, wijzig je de status van de werkorder naar :guilabel:`Te doen`. "
"Wijzig vervolgens, om een nieuw item toe te voegen en het werk te hervatten, "
"de status van de werkorder terug naar :guilabel:`In uitvoering`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/manufacturing_work_orders.rst:119
msgid ""
"If :guilabel:`Instructions` are included, click an instruction. The *Open: "
"Check* window opens. Click the :icon:`fa-expand` :guilabel:`(Expand)` icon "
"in the top corner of the pop-up window. A quality check order form opens. "
"Follow the :guilabel:`Instructions`, then click :guilabel:`Pass` to mark the "
"instruction as completed."
msgstr ""
"Als :guilabel:`Instructies` zijn inbegrepen, klik dan op een instructie. Het "
"venster *Openen: Controle* opent. Klik op het :icon:`fa-expand` :guilabel:`"
"(Uitvouwen)` icoon in de bovenhoek van het pop-upvenster. Er opent een "
"formulier voor kwaliteitscontrole. Volg de :guilabel:`Instructies` en klik "
"vervolgens op :guilabel:`Slagen` om de instructie als voltooid te markeren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/manufacturing_work_orders.rst:125
msgid ""
"For an easier path to complete work orders, click the :icon:`oi-view-"
"kanban` :guilabel:`Open Shop Floor` smart button to open the *Shop Floor* "
"module, filtered to the |MO|, then :ref:`process the work order in Shop "
"Floor <manufacturing/basic_setup/complete-wo>`."
msgstr ""
"Voor een makkelijkere manier om werkorders te voltooien, klik op de "
":icon:`oi-view-kanban` :guilabel:`Werkvloer openen` slimme knop om de module "
"*Werkvloer* te openen, gefilterd op de |MO|, en :ref:`verwerk de werkorder "
"in de Werkvloer <manufacturing/basic_setup/complete-wo>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/manufacturing_work_orders.rst:129
msgid ""
"After all instructions are completed, complete the work order by changing "
"its status to :guilabel:`Done`."
msgstr ""
"Nadat alle instructies zijn voltooid, voltooi je de werkorder door de status "
"te wijzigen naar :guilabel:`Gereed`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/manufacturing_work_orders.rst:132
msgid ""
"After all work orders for the |MO| are complete, :ref:`complete the MO "
"<manufacturing/basic_setup/complete-mo>`."
msgstr ""
"Nadat alle werkorders voor de |MO| voltooid zijn, :ref:`voltooi de "
"productieorder <manufacturing/basic_setup/complete-mo>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/manufacturing_work_orders.rst:138
msgid "Complete the MO"
msgstr "Voltooi de productieorder"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/manufacturing_work_orders.rst:140
msgid ""
"Back in the |MO| form, after completing all work orders, "
"click :guilabel:`Produce` at the top of the screen to mark the |MO| "
"as :guilabel:`Done` and register the manufactured products into inventory."
msgstr ""
"Terug in het |MO| formulier, klik je na het voltooien van alle werkorders op "
":guilabel:`Produceren` bovenaan het scherm om de |MO| te markeren als "
":guilabel:`Gereed` en de gefabriceerde producten in de voorraad te "
"registreren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/manufacturing_work_orders.rst:146
msgid "Partially complete the MO"
msgstr "De MO gedeeltelijk voltooien"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/manufacturing_work_orders.rst:148
msgid ""
"To produce a partial quantity of the manufacturing order, enter the number "
"in the :guilabel:`Quantity` field at the top of the manufacturing order, "
"then click :guilabel:`Produce`. If the quantity of consumed materials does "
"not match the quantity of products produced, a *Consumption Warning* pop-up "
"window appears. Click :guilabel:`Confirm` to keep the existing quantity of "
"consumed materials, or click :guilabel:`Update Quantities & Validate` to "
"match the consumed quantities to the partial MO quantity of products "
"produced."
msgstr ""
"Voer voor een gedeeltelijke hoeveelheid van de productieorder het getal in "
"in het veld :guilabel:`Hoeveelheid` bovenaan de productieorder en klik "
"vervolgens op :guilabel:`Produceren`. Als de hoeveelheid verbruikte "
"materialen niet overeenkomt met de hoeveelheid geproduceerde producten, "
"verschijnt er een pop-upvenster *Verbruikswaarschuwing*. Klik op "
":guilabel:`Bevestigen` om de bestaande hoeveelheid verbruikte materialen te "
"behouden, of klik op :guilabel:`Hoeveelheden bijwerken & Valideren` om de "
"verbruikte hoeveelheden af te stemmen op de gedeeltelijke MO-hoeveelheid "
"geproduceerde producten."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/manufacturing_work_orders.rst:155
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Close Production` in the *You produced less than the "
"initial demand* pop-up window, and a second *Consumption Warning* pop-up "
"window appears. Click :guilabel:`Confirm` to keep the existing quantity of "
"consumed materials, or click :guilabel:`Update Quantities & Validate` to "
"match the consumed quantities to the full MO quantity of products produced."
msgstr ""
"Klik op :guilabel:`Productie sluiten` in het pop-upvenster *Je hebt minder "
"geproduceerd dan de initiële vraag* en er verschijnt een tweede pop-"
"upvenster *Verbruikswaarschuwing*. Klik op :guilabel:`Bevestigen` om de "
"bestaande hoeveelheid verbruikte materialen te behouden, of klik op "
":guilabel:`Hoeveelheden bijwerken & Valideren` om de verbruikte hoeveelheden "
"af te stemmen op de volledige MO-hoeveelheid geproduceerde producten."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/manufacturing_work_orders.rst:160
msgid ""
"The |MO| is marked as :guilabel:`Done` and the manufactured products are "
"registered into inventory."
msgstr ""
"De |MO| is gemarkeerd als :guilabel:`Gereed` en de geproduceerde producten "
"zijn geregistreerd in de voorraad."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/manufacturing_work_orders.rst:163
msgid ""
"To create a backorder for the remaining quantity, see :ref:`Manufacturing "
"backorders <manufacturing/manufacturing-backorders/create-backorder-"
"manufacturing-app>`."
msgstr ""
"Zie :ref:`Productie backorders <manufacturing/manufacturing-backorders/"
"create-backorder-manufacturing-app>` om een backorder te maken voor de "
"resterende hoeveelheid."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/manufacturing_work_orders.rst:169
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/one_step_manufacturing.rst:81
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing.rst:102
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing.rst:98
msgid "Shop Floor workflow"
msgstr "Werkvloerworkflow"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/manufacturing_work_orders.rst:171
msgid ""
"To complete the work orders for an |MO| using the *Shop Floor* module, begin "
"by navigating to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Operations --> "
"Manufacturing Orders`, and then select an |MO|."
msgstr ""
"Om de werkorders voor een |MO| te voltooien met de module *Werkvloer*, "
"navigeer je eerst naar :menuselection:`Productie-app --> Bewerkingen --> "
"Productieorders` en selecteer je vervolgens een |MO|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/manufacturing_work_orders.rst:174
msgid ""
"Manufacturing orders can be opened in the *Shop Floor* module from two "
"different locations:"
msgstr ""
"Productieorders kunnen op twee verschillende plaatsen in de module "
"*Werkvloer* worden geopend:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/manufacturing_work_orders.rst:176
msgid ":ref:`From the MO form <manufacturing/basic_setup/shop-floor-from-mo>`"
msgstr ""
